#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Available options for building with Qiskit Runtime primitives"
msgid "Available options for building with IBM Quantum primitives"
msgstr "Opsi yang tersedia untuk membangun dengan primitif Qiskit Runtime"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to options"
msgstr "Pengenalan opsi"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to options {#introduction-to-options}"
msgstr "Pengenalan opsi {#introduction-to-options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid " You can use options to customize Qiskit Runtime primitives to meet your needs.\n"
msgid " You can use options to customize IBM Quantum primitives to meet your needs.\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa menggunakan opsi untuk menyesuaikan primitif Qiskit Runtime sesuai kebutuhanmu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"options-structure\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"options-structure\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Structure {#structure}"
msgstr "Struktur {#structure}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When calling the primitives, you can pass in options by using an options class or a dictionary. Commonly-used options, such as `resilience_level`, are at the first level. Other options are grouped into categories, such as `execution`. Specify the options in this format:  `options.option.sub-option.sub-sub-option = choice`.  For example: `options.dynamical_decoupling.enable = True`.\n"
msgstr "Saat memanggil primitif, kamu bisa meneruskan opsi menggunakan kelas opsi atau dictionary. Opsi yang sering digunakan, seperti `resilience_level`, ada di level pertama. Opsi lainnya dikelompokkan ke dalam kategori, seperti `execution`. Tentukan opsi dengan format ini:  `options.option.sub-option.sub-sub-option = choice`.  Misalnya: `options.dynamical_decoupling.enable = True`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"options-defaults\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"options-defaults\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Defaults {#defaults}"
msgstr "Default {#defaults}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you do not specify a value for an option, it is given a special value of `Unset` and the server default value is used. Thus, the default value will be the same regardless of your code version.\n"
msgstr "Kalau kamu tidak menentukan nilai untuk suatu opsi, opsi itu akan diberi nilai khusus `Unset` dan nilai default server yang akan dipakai. Jadi, nilai default-nya akan sama terlepas dari versi kode kamu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The tables in the \"Options classes summary\" section on each primitive's \"options\" guide lists the default values.\n"
msgstr "Tabel di bagian \"Options classes summary\" pada setiap panduan \"options\" primitif mencantumkan nilai default-nya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"options-precedence\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"options-precedence\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set options {#set-options}"
msgstr "Set opsi {#set-options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Options can be defined before a primitive is constructed and passed to the primitive as an instance of the options class or a dictionary.  The primitive makes a copy of them, which means that changing the original dictionary or options instance doesn't affect the options that the primitive owns. \n"
msgstr "Opsi bisa didefinisikan sebelum primitif dibuat lalu diteruskan ke primitif sebagai instance dari kelas opsi atau sebagai dictionary.  Primitif akan membuat salinannya, yang berarti mengubah dictionary atau instance opsi aslinya tidak memengaruhi opsi yang dimiliki primitif. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additionally, you can change the options after the primitive is constructed. Use the workflow that works best for your application. \n"
msgstr "Selain itu, kamu bisa mengubah opsi setelah primitif dibuat. Gunakan alur kerja yang paling cocok untuk aplikasimu. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes about specifying primitive options\">\n"
"- You can see the available options during or after primitive initialization.\n"
"- If you do not specify a value for an option, it is given a special value of `Unset` and the server defaults are used.\n"
"- The `options` attribute is the `dataclass` Python type.  You can use the built-in `asdict` method to convert it to a dictionary.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Catatan tentang menentukan opsi primitif\">\n"
"- Kamu bisa melihat opsi yang tersedia selama atau setelah inisialisasi primitif.\n"
"- Kalau kamu tidak menentukan nilai untuk suatu opsi, opsi itu akan diberi nilai khusus `Unset` dan default server yang dipakai.\n"
"- Atribut `options` bertipe Python `dataclass`.  Kamu bisa menggunakan metode bawaan `asdict` untuk mengonversinya menjadi dictionary.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "`options` class {#options-class}"
msgstr "Kelas `options` {#options-class}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When creating an instance of the primitive class, you can pass in an instance of the `options` class. Those options are then applied when you use `run()` to perform the calculation.  Specify the options in this format:  `options.option.sub-option.sub-sub-option = choice`.  For example: `options.dynamical_decoupling.enable = True`.\n"
msgstr "Saat membuat instance dari kelas primitif, kamu bisa meneruskan instance dari kelas `options`. Opsi tersebut kemudian diterapkan saat kamu menggunakan `run()` untuk melakukan komputasi.  Tentukan opsi dengan format ini:  `options.option.sub-option.sub-sub-option = choice`.  Misalnya: `options.dynamical_decoupling.enable = True`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "See [`SamplerOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-sampler-options) or [`EstimatorOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-estimator-options) for full details about the class.\n"
msgstr "Lihat [`SamplerOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-sampler-options) atau [`EstimatorOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-estimator-options) untuk detail lengkap tentang kelas tersebut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following example uses the Estimator primitive, but the syntax for other primitives is similar.\n"
msgstr "Contoh berikut menggunakan primitif Estimator, tapi sintaks untuk primitif lain mirip.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dictionary {#dictionary}"
msgstr "Dictionary {#dictionary}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can specify options as a dictionary when initializing a primitive.\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa menentukan opsi sebagai dictionary saat menginisialisasi primitif.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"update-options\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"update-options\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update options after initialization {#update-options-after-initialization}"
msgstr "Perbarui opsi setelah inisialisasi {#update-options-after-initialization}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can specify the options in this format: `_primitive_.options.option.sub-option.sub-sub-option = choice` to take advantage of auto-complete, or use the `update()` method to make bulk updates.\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa menentukan opsi dengan format ini: `_primitive_.options.option.sub-option.sub-sub-option = choice` untuk memanfaatkan auto-complete, atau gunakan metode `update()` untuk melakukan pembaruan secara massal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The primitive's options class ([`EstimatorOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-estimator-options) or [`SamplerOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-sampler-options)) does not need to be instantiated if you are setting options after initializing the primitive.\n"
msgstr "Kelas opsi primitif ([`EstimatorOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-estimator-options) atau [`SamplerOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-sampler-options)) tidak perlu diinstansiasi kalau kamu menyetel opsi setelah menginisialisasi primitif.\n"

